<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
    <mj-head>
        <mj-title>Introducing Grace Audit — The Newest Addition to the Grace Family</mj-title>
        <mj-preview>Today we are delighted to introduce Grace Audit, a purpose-built internal audit management solution for the public sector.</mj-preview>
        <mj-breakpoint width="600px" />
        <mj-attributes>
            <mj-all font-family="Ubuntu, Arial, sans-serif" />
            <mj-text padding="0" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" />
            <mj-section padding="0" />
            <mj-class name="heading" padding="20px 32px 8px" color="#0070f3" font-size="26px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.25" letter-spacing="-0.01em" />
            <mj-class name="subheading" padding="16px 32px 4px" color="#0070f3" font-size="19px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.3" letter-spacing="-0.005em" />
            <mj-class name="paddit" padding="8px 32px" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="16px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.65" />
            <mj-class name="lead" padding="8px 32px" color="#2a2a3a" font-size="17px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.65" />
            <mj-class name="date" padding="0 32px" color="#1e5bbf" font-size="14px" font-weight="500" align="right" letter-spacing="0.02em" />
            <mj-class name="header-title" padding="16px 32px 4px" color="#0070f3" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.2" letter-spacing="-0.015em" />
            <mj-class name="header-tagline" padding="0 32px 16px" color="#1e5bbf" font-size="15px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.04em" />
            <mj-class name="header-issue" padding="0 32px 16px" color="#1e5bbf" font-size="15px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.08em" />
            <mj-class name="cta-heading" padding="8px 25px" color="#0070f3" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.3" align="center" letter-spacing="-0.01em" />
            <mj-class name="cta-text" padding="8px 32px 20px" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" align="center" />
            <mj-class name="footer-text" padding="8px 25px" color="#7a7a8a" font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" align="center" />
            <mj-button background-color="#0070f3" color="#ffffff" font-size="16px" font-weight="600" inner-padding="14px 36px" border-radius="8px" letter-spacing="0.02em" />
            <mj-divider border-color="#d8e7fb" border-width="1px" padding="20px 32px 4px" />
            <mj-social icon-size="28px" mode="horizontal" align="center" inner-padding="0 8px" />
        </mj-attributes>
        <mj-html-attributes>
            <mj-selector path=".flexy table">
                <mj-html-attribute name="data-id">42</mj-html-attribute>
            </mj-selector>
        </mj-html-attributes>
        <mj-style>
            .flexy table { margin: 0; }
            a { color: #0070f3; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; transition: color 0.2s ease; }
            a:hover { color: #1e5bbf; }
            .article-list { margin: 4px 0 0; padding-left: 22px; }
            .article-list li { margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.65; padding-left: 4px; }
            .article-list li::marker { color: #1e5bbf; }
            strong { color: #0070f3; font-weight: 700; }
            @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
                .mobile-pad { padding: 16px 8px !important; }
                .mobile-center { text-align: center !important; }
                .mobile-center img { margin: 0 auto !important; }
            }
        </mj-style>
    </mj-head>
    <mj-body width="1080px" background-color="#f0f6ff">
        <mj-include path="assets/styles/screen.css" type="css" />
        <mj-raw><!-- Message body --></mj-raw>

        <mj-raw><!-- Top accent bar --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#0070f3" padding="0">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-spacer height="4px" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Header --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#dfd9fd" background-size="cover" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding="28px 8px">
            <mj-column vertical-align="middle" width="60%">
                <mj-text mj-class="header-title">Swifton Solutions Newsletter</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="header-issue">JUNE 2026  ·  ISSUE #3</mj-text>
            </mj-column>
            <mj-column vertical-align="middle" width="40%" css-class="mobile-center">
                <mj-image align="right" width="200px" padding="0 24px" src="assets/images/swifton.png" alt="Swifton Solutions Logo" title="Swifton Solutions" />
                <mj-text mj-class="date" css-class="update-date"></mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Main content --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="36px 8px 24px">
            <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
                <mj-text mj-class="lead" padding="0 32px 12px">Hello {firstName},</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">We have some exciting news to share, and if you have been following our recent announcements, we think this one will particularly interest you.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Today we are delighted to introduce <strong>Grace Audit</strong> — a purpose-built internal audit management solution, and the newest addition to the Grace family alongside <a href="https://gracegs.com/#products" title="Grace Governance Solutions" target="_blank">GRACE, HARRIET, and Connie</a>.</mj-text>
                <mj-divider />
                <mj-text mj-class="heading">Introducing Grace Audit</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Grace Audit is designed specifically for internal audit teams in the public sector. If your team is currently managing audit programmes through a combination of Word documents, Excel trackers, and email threads, Grace Audit brings everything together in one place — from annual planning right through to your Head of Audit's annual opinion.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">We built it to be used by small audit teams without specialist IT support, and to reflect the way public sector internal audit works.</mj-text>
                <mj-divider />
                <mj-text mj-class="heading">What Grace Audit includes</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="subheading">Core Audit Management</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Create and manage audit engagements with title, status, risk level, planned days, and start/due dates. A clear status workflow takes each audit from Planning through Fieldwork, Reporting, Complete, and Archived — with RAG status tracking throughout.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="subheading">Audit Universe</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">A risk-ranked register of all your auditable areas, scored by likelihood and impact to support your annual audit plan. Track last audited year, assurance level, responsible owner, and department — and link universe entries directly to live audit engagements.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="subheading">Audit Tasks &amp; Procedures</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Add tasks to each audit manually, from a pre-built template library, or via CSV import. Grace Audit includes 15 standard task templates across Planning, Fieldwork, Reporting, and Follow-up phases, plus 10 subject-matter procedure templates covering areas including:</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit" padding="4px 32px 8px"><ul class="article-list">
                    <li>Procurement</li>
                    <li>Payroll</li>
                    <li>IT &amp; Cyber</li>
                    <li>Housing Benefits</li>
                    <li>Safeguarding</li>
                    <li>Grant Funding</li>
                </ul></mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Each task has a built-in time tracker, review and sign-off workflow, and workpaper file attachments.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="subheading">Recommendations Tracker</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Formal recommendation tracking across all audits, with risk ratings, status workflow, target dates, overdue indicators, and progress updates. Never lose sight of an outstanding action again.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="subheading">Reports</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Generate an Audit Report per engagement and an Annual Opinion at portfolio level — pulling directly from your findings, risks, and recommendations, with no copy-pasting required.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="subheading">Dashboard</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">A live summary across all active audits showing task completion rates, overdue items, RAG distribution, and time tracking totals.</mj-text>
                <mj-divider />
                <mj-text mj-class="heading">Why now?</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">With Swifton's full development capability behind the Grace suite, we have been able to move quickly on features that public sector teams need but struggled to find in a solution that is affordable, practical, and easy to adopt.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Grace Audit is the result — and we are proud to bring it to market as part of the same trusted suite our customers already rely on.</mj-text>
                <mj-divider />
                <mj-text mj-class="heading">Find out more</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">We will be hosting a virtual showcase of all the Grace solutions. Details to follow shortly.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">In the meantime, please do not hesitate to reach out to us at <a href="mailto:info@rapid-is.co.uk">info@rapid-is.co.uk</a> if you would like a conversation, an early look, or simply want to know more. We are always happy to arrange a call or a visit.</mj-text>
                <mj-spacer height="8px" />
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Best regards,<br />The Swifton Solutions team.</mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- CTA section --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#dfd9fd" padding="44px 16px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-text mj-class="cta-heading">Want to see Grace Audit in action?</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="cta-text">Get in touch with the Swifton Solutions team to request an early look or arrange a conversation about how Grace Audit could work for your organisation.</mj-text>
                <mj-button href="https://swifton.co.uk/contact/" title="Get In Touch">Get In Touch</mj-button>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Footer --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="32px 16px 12px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-social css-class="flexy row gap-1">
                    <mj-social-element name="web-noshare" href="https://swifton.co.uk/" title="Web">Web</mj-social-element>
                    <mj-social-element name="linkedin-noshare" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/rapid-information-systems/" title="LinkedIn">LinkedIn</mj-social-element>
                </mj-social>
                <mj-divider padding="20px 32px 8px" />
                <mj-text mj-class="footer-text"><a href="{unsubscribe_link}">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Bottom accent bar --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#0070f3" padding="0">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-spacer height="4px" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
    </mj-body>
</mjml>